Package: firefox.appimage
Version: 160.0-2
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.28), uoshim-wayland-im
Maintainer: Local Build <local@localhost>
Description: Firefox (stock AppImage) with Kirin9000c/Maleoon910 hardware acceleration
 Stock Firefox AppImage launched via LD_PRELOAD shims for native Wayland,
 hardware WebRender, WebGL on Maleoon 910, and H264 VAAPI decoding on UOS20.
 The AppImage binary is unmodified; all acceleration is done by shims in
 /opt/mozilla-firefox/lib. Source is included in /opt/mozilla-firefox/src.
